Steam Switch RS

The Switch 2 protocol implementation incorporates MIT-licensed material from
esp-cpp/espp, copyright 2022 esp-cpp. The original notice is reproduced in
firmware/src/console/LICENSE-espp.

The motion payload uses protocol techniques described by notsosaelin and other
PicoSwitch2 contributors under the Apache License, Version 2.0. This project's
Rust motion module implements the payload and its own sensor fusion.

Steam Controller input format references include SDL (zlib license) and
JoypadOS (Apache License, Version 2.0). Their projects publish the report
formats used to implement this project's Rust input parser.
